{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cat Go: Tactical Defense Braw",
    "steam_appid": 3164400,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/ecfad98bec450e42adb13423e3ed3e25.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuteness is optional. Strategy is a must. Cats Go is a 4-player co-op action game that blends tower defense, shooting, strategy, and... cats! Armed with plant-powered towers, your feline squad is ready to defend the village! Team up, build your strategy, and work together to expose the mysterious demon cat hiding among you. \u25a0 This is NOT your typical tower defense game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 This is NOT your typical tower defense game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[ Don\u2019t be fooled by the cuteness ]</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your village using plant towers installed by cats themselves. A purr-fect blend of shooting action and tower defense gameplay! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[ A suspicious cat? The Demon Mode is here! ]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An evil cat is pretending to be a teammate and sneaking through the village. Sniff out the suspicious kitty and vote them out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>[ Supports 1\u20134 Players (Online Co-op &amp; Local Multiplayer) ]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team up with friends, build your leafy towers, and defend together! Running low on meat? Time to call in a friend boost! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[ Tons of Maps &amp; Challenges Await ]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New maps, new plans\u2014every match is a fresh challenge! Dive into the purr-fect world of strategic cat defense, whether you're a newbie or a master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/374f4e9490bccfb2b598e3d7680037c1.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/be1fdb0cd0de0c1f2a052db0a25a0adc.poster.avif?t=1754736393\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/be1fdb0cd0de0c1f2a052db0a25a0adc.webm?t=1754736393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <u><strong>Solo Mode</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a fearless cat and defend your village alone by crafting the perfect strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <u><strong>Multiplayer - Co-op</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends through online play and work together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running low on resources? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're running low on meat, borrowing a little wouldn\u2019t hurt, would it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <u><strong>Multiplayer - Devi</strong></u><strong>l\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc08\u200d\u2b1b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devil disguised as a cat is hiding among your teammates! The devil cat sets traps and stuns plants, secretly sabotaging the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you suspect someone, hold a vote and banish the devil cat from the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/e676bf2a0ec69f45b1f8450683f6b1f4.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/753e155e0062ccf8a97ea40414e274ca.poster.avif?t=1754736393\" width=800 height=213 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/753e155e0062ccf8a97ea40414e274ca.webm?t=1754736393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own plant towers to protect the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of quirky, cat-friendly mutant plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, Care, and evolve them into powerful towers to keep your village safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/a1d8846cc9cfb38e113272ffa463ac32.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through diverse and beautifully designed maps with varying difficulty levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your way to victory and enjoy the satisfaction of clearing each map with your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/ecfad98bec450e42adb13423e3ed3e25.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuteness is optional. Strategy is a must. Cats Go is a 4-player co-op action game that blends tower defense, shooting, strategy, and... cats! Armed with plant-powered towers, your feline squad is ready to defend the village! Team up, build your strategy, and work together to expose the mysterious demon cat hiding among you. \u25a0 This is NOT your typical tower defense game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 This is NOT your typical tower defense game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[ Don\u2019t be fooled by the cuteness ]</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your village using plant towers installed by cats themselves. A purr-fect blend of shooting action and tower defense gameplay! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[ A suspicious cat? The Demon Mode is here! ]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An evil cat is pretending to be a teammate and sneaking through the village. Sniff out the suspicious kitty and vote them out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>[ Supports 1\u20134 Players (Online Co-op &amp; Local Multiplayer) ]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team up with friends, build your leafy towers, and defend together! Running low on meat? Time to call in a friend boost! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[ Tons of Maps &amp; Challenges Await ]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New maps, new plans\u2014every match is a fresh challenge! Dive into the purr-fect world of strategic cat defense, whether you're a newbie or a master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/374f4e9490bccfb2b598e3d7680037c1.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/be1fdb0cd0de0c1f2a052db0a25a0adc.poster.avif?t=1754736393\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/be1fdb0cd0de0c1f2a052db0a25a0adc.webm?t=1754736393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <u><strong>Solo Mode</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a fearless cat and defend your village alone by crafting the perfect strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <u><strong>Multiplayer - Co-op</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends through online play and work together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running low on resources? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're running low on meat, borrowing a little wouldn\u2019t hurt, would it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <u><strong>Multiplayer - Devi</strong></u><strong>l\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc08\u200d\u2b1b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devil disguised as a cat is hiding among your teammates! The devil cat sets traps and stuns plants, secretly sabotaging the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you suspect someone, hold a vote and banish the devil cat from the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/e676bf2a0ec69f45b1f8450683f6b1f4.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/753e155e0062ccf8a97ea40414e274ca.poster.avif?t=1754736393\" width=800 height=213 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/753e155e0062ccf8a97ea40414e274ca.webm?t=1754736393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own plant towers to protect the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of quirky, cat-friendly mutant plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, Care, and evolve them into powerful towers to keep your village safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164400/extras/a1d8846cc9cfb38e113272ffa463ac32.avif?t=1754736393\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through diverse and beautifully designed maps with varying difficulty levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your way to victory and enjoy the satisfaction of clearing each map with your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Cats Go! is a defense game blending strategy, cooperation, and direct combat. Grow mutant plants to protect your village! Whether you prefer to play solo as a brave defender or team up with friends online. Not feeling cooperative? Slip into the role of a devil cat and secretly sabotage the village!",
